#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:4
msgid ""
"**Scope.** pygeofetch has a layered settings model "
"(`pygeofetch.config.settings.Settings`), but in the current release only the"
" `pygeofetch config` commands and `pygeofetch cache ttl` read it. The "
"search, download and processing code does **not** consult it. Changing "
"`download.parallel` in `config.yaml` or through "
"`PYGEOFETCH_DOWNLOAD__PARALLEL` does not change how many downloads run."
msgstr ""
"**Portée.** pygeofetch dispose d'un modèle de paramètres en couches "
"(`pygeofetch.config.settings.Settings`), mais dans la version actuelle "
"seules les commandes `pygeofetch config` et `pygeofetch cache ttl` le "
"lisent. Le code de recherche, de téléchargement et de traitement ne le "
"consulte **pas**. Modifier `download.parallel` dans `config.yaml` ou via "
"`PYGEOFETCH_DOWNLOAD__PARALLEL` ne change pas le nombre de téléchargements "
"exécutés."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:10
msgid ""
"Behaviour is controlled by the [options that actually take effect](#what-"
"controls-behaviour) below. See [Known issues](known-issues.md#settings-"
"layer-is-not-applied-at-runtime)."
msgstr ""
"Le comportement est contrôlé par les [options réellement prises en "
"compte](#what-controls-behaviour) ci-dessous. Voir [Problèmes connus](known-"
"issues.md#settings-layer-is-not-applied-at-runtime)."

