#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:132
msgid ""
"`config set` writes to `~/.pygeofetch/config.yaml`. As described above, the "
"value is stored and shown by `config show`, but search and download do not "
"read it."
msgstr ""
"`config set` écrit dans `~/.pygeofetch/config.yaml`. Comme décrit ci-dessus,"
" la valeur est stockée et affichée par `config show`, mais la recherche et "
"le téléchargement ne la lisent pas."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/configuration.md:136
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch cache ttl show` reads a field that does not exist on `Settings` "
"and always prints `3600`. `pygeofetch cache ttl set N` does store "
"`cache.ttl_seconds`. See [Known issues](known-issues.md)."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch cache ttl show` lit un champ qui n'existe pas dans `Settings` et"
" affiche toujours `3600`. `pygeofetch cache ttl set N` stocke bien "
"`cache.ttl_seconds`. Voir [Problèmes connus](known-issues.md)."

